.venv/
.claude/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
data/*
# Real per-game NHL goalie boxscore data -- committed as a one-time seed
# (unlike every other pipeline's pulled data) because rebuilding it from
# scratch means ~9,800 individual rate-limited API calls (~25hrs observed),
# which can't run inside a single CI job. refresh.yml pulls only the small
# incremental delta (newly completed games) each run and commits it back
# here, same as docs/index.html. A git-ignored directory hides its
# contents from negation patterns, so this has to explicitly re-include
# each path segment down to the one real file.
!data/nhl
data/nhl/*
!data/nhl/goalie_game_logs.parquet
notebooks_out/
pipeline/nfl/*_filled.html
pipeline/nfl/*_artifact*.html
